# Channel 0 — GitHub.
# Without a token the build falls back to the public contributions document,
# which yields the same calendar with slightly coarser counts. With a token it
# uses the GraphQL contributionsCollection field and gets exact counts.
# Scope required: none (a classic token with no scopes, or a fine-grained token
# with read-only public access, is enough).
GITHUB_USERNAME=Mudit13-tech
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Channel 1 — LeetCode. No credentials exist for this endpoint; it is the
# community GraphQL API and it is queried server-side at build time, so CORS
# never applies and no proxy is needed.
LEETCODE_USERNAME=Mudit1306
